    "detailed_description": "<i>Glitch Maze.exe</i> is a casual maze game, that draws inspiration from games like Pac-Man, while adding <strong>subtle</strong> horror elements. <br>The game embraces the concept of using your past failures to progress: every time you die, you leave behind a small beacon of light that reveals parts of the maze and dangers lurking in it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/77e78a9e816de1a8ee60310544997fed.poster.avif?t=1713207832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/77e78a9e816de1a8ee60310544997fed.webm?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/77e78a9e816de1a8ee60310544997fed.mp4?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Explore 18 handcrafted mazes</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/72acd1e132f9ceda229b34d1533d8aaf.poster.avif?t=1713207832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/72acd1e132f9ceda229b34d1533d8aaf.webm?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/72acd1e132f9ceda229b34d1533d8aaf.mp4?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Use your past failures to beat the maze or play cautiously</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/b681ce7693f0c10197eae91526d05496.poster.avif?t=1713207832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/b681ce7693f0c10197eae91526d05496.webm?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/b681ce7693f0c10197eae91526d05496.mp4?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Use power-ups to highlight or freeze the dangers</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/fd5d7d94668c835517186761f95a02d9.poster.avif?t=1713207832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/fd5d7d94668c835517186761f95a02d9.webm?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/fd5d7d94668c835517186761f95a02d9.mp4?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Gather high scores to alter the dynamic on the level</strong></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/82f526c0886562b1db8bf81e2be634c3.poster.avif?t=1713207832\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/82f526c0886562b1db8bf81e2be634c3.webm?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892300/extras/82f526c0886562b1db8bf81e2be634c3.mp4?t=1713207832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Find sercrets</strong></li></ul>"